  "title": "AEP Reports Second-Quarter 2026 Earnings, Raises Full-Year Guidance",
  "summary": "Raises full-year 2026 operating earnings guidance to $6.25 to $6.55 per share Supports affordability with up to $16 billion in expected cost offsets from load growth and $1.4 billion in expected customer savings from federal loan guarantees and grants Expands new load additions to 69 gigawatts (GW) through 2030 Secures approximately 13 GW of gas-fired turbine capacity; additional 10 GW under evaluation to meet growing demand",
